# Turbopack Sass cache

Next 16 caches compiled component SCSS in `.next/dev/cache` (`experimental.turbopackFileSystemCacheForDev`). The cache survives a restart and is not invalidated when a forwarded partial changes.

Adding or changing a token or mixin in `styles/config/*` (reached through `styles/_globals.scss` `@forward`) can make `next dev` return 500 with "Undefined variable" or "Undefined mixin" on every route. `npx sass` and `next build` still compile.

Do not stop the dev server, delete the cache, or restart it. Tell Victor to stop the server, run `rm -rf .next/dev/cache`, and start it again. A plain restart is not enough.
